Built from APGRoboCop/rcbotold at v1.51b13 (43ecb57) with the five patches in
rcbot-patch/, applied in this order (rcbot-patch/README.txt, REBUILDING):

  1. rcbot-ts-teams.patch         CHANGES 1-4: TS teams from pev->team, nopowerup
                                  and the dry weapon, the follow command, cloak
                                  awareness
  2. rcbot-tsweaps-crash.patch    CHANGE 5: the TS weapon-learning crash
  3. rcbot-build-fixes.patch      what CHANGES 3 and 5 need to compile: the follow
                                  command's prototypes in bot.h, CBotGlobals::GetBot,
                                  the CBotSquads::createSquad stub, RemoveSimilarTask,
                                  the weapon choice re-seeded in place, and
                                  returnVector()->size()
  4. rcbot-waypoints-doors.patch  CHANGE 6
  5. rcbot-ts-turrets.patch       CHANGE 7, new in this build: the other side's
                                  sentry turret is an enemy, one's own never is
                                  (its diff is the first below)

Patch 3 is the part of the 10/22 build no patch held: patches 1 and 2 alone give
a tree that does not compile. With it, the five patches on a fresh checkout of
v1.51b13 give, file for file, the source this DLL was built from (all 154 files
in dlls/, line endings aside), and this DLL was built from that checkout:
MSBuild, MetaMod Release, Win32, MSVC v145 -- 0 errors, and no warning in a line
any of the patches changes.

